# Labelled-sidecar fixture: He3 chain in 6-31G with a KBJ s ghost on the middle atom and an
# off-atom ghost, localized orbitals. Small enough to commit (8+3 orbitals).
# Regenerate: OMP_NUM_THREADS=4 python scripts/fcidump/dump_fcidump.py --input testdata/khci/he3_ghost.in
&geometry
  file   he3_ghost.xyz
  unit   angstrom
&basis
  name   6-31g
&scf
  charge 0
  spin   0
  symmetry off
&ghost_sites
  GT    1.30 0.0 0.0  kbj:0:2-3
  GOFF  1.30 1.5 0.0  kbj:0:4-4
&orbitals
  scheme        localized
  compact_basis 6-31g
  lindep        1e-6
&output
  fcidump  he3_ghost.fcidump
  sidecar  he3_ghost.mo.json
  manifest he3_ghost.ref.json
